    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i mean i know i should probably see someone eventually but i just cant deal with a clinic right now. it really just feels like a tight knot in my neck and my jaw is super sore. if i just took like 800mg of ibuprofen every few hours for a day or two, would that be enough to knock out the inflammation? i just need to know what's safe to do tonight since i'm sure it's just stress.",
